From: Liam Curtis <liamcurtis81@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 10:29:44 +0000
Subject: ASP: follow upstream's scaler move to C in makefile.asp (fba_v54)

Upstream replaced the x86 asm scalers (hq2x/3x/4x, 2xSaI, Eagle,
SuperScale) with C files and vid_softfx.cpp now calls them on every
platform, so makefile.asp has to build hqx, hq2x, hq3x, hq4x, 2xsai16,
eagle, superscale, hq3xs and hq_shared32 or the link fails. The old
BUILD_X86_ASM block is gone.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017bFDpwj71bNUcXJZGTv8su
---
 makefile.asp | 5 +----
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/makefile.asp b/makefile.asp
index 3e66e9cbc..b1a171d30 100644
--- a/makefile.asp
+++ b/makefile.asp
@@ -92,7 +92,7 @@ depobj += cdlist.o \
 		interface.o lowpass2.o  vid_interface.o vid_softfx.o \
 		vid_support.o \
 		\
-		2xpm.o 2xsai.o ddt3x.o epx.o hq2xs.o hq2xs_16.o xbr.o xbr32.o \
+		2xpm.o 2xsai.o 2xsai16.o ddt3x.o epx.o hq2xs.o hq2xs_16.o hqx.o hq2x.o hq3x.o hq4x.o eagle.o superscale.o hq3xs.o hq_shared32.o xbr.o xbr32.o \
 		\
 		inp_pi.o aud_sdl.o support_paths.o \
 		ips_manager.o scrn.o config.o \
@@ -110,9 +110,6 @@ endif
 
 autobj += $(depobj)
 
-ifdef BUILD_X86_ASM
-autobj += eagle_fm.o 2xsaimmx.o hq2x32.o hq3x32.o hq4x32.o superscale.o
-endif
 # End platform-specific
 
 
